     "text": "Write the dividend in descending powers (insert 0 for any missing power).",
     "latex": "\\left(n^{3} + 3 n^{2} - 5 n - 4\\right)\\div\\left(n + 4\\right)"
    },
    {
     "text": "Synthetic division uses the zero of the divisor, n = -4. Bring down, multiply by -4, add.",
