    },
    {
     "text": "Check: divisor × quotient + remainder = dividend.",
     "latex": "\\left(x - 4\\right)\\left(2 x^{2} - 5 x + 6\\right)+0=2 x^{3} - 13 x^{2} + 26 x - 24"
